# Selections, the diff, a rebase in progress and a few dialogs. Verbs the regions do not support yet fail their
# step. The full verb list of a build is written to verbs.txt in the output directory.
open repository rich
select log row 1
shot rich-commit-selected
select uncommitted row
select file unstaged src/app.txt
shot rich-unstaged-diff
set diff split
shot rich-unstaged-diff-split
set diff unified
clear file selection
open dialog about
shot dialog-about
close dialog
open settings page appearance
shot settings-appearance
close dialog
open repository rebase
shot rebase-in-progress
assert no error
